Noncommercial Purposes
----------------------
A permitted purpose is any noncommercial purpose. A noncommercial
purpose is any purpose that is not a commercial purpose. A
commercial purpose is any purpose that is primarily intended for or
directed towards commercial advantage or monetary compensation,
including but not limited to:

1.  using the software to provide a commercial service, whether or
